  - `is_true`: bool(value) is True; `is_none`: value is None.
  - `absent`? kinds present: equals, contains, is_true, is_none. Good.
- Compare recorded pass vs computed pass on rev12 snapshot; count mismatches.
- On rev13 compute pass; count flips.
- Excerpt drift: compare recorded observed_excerpt vs live serialized value prefix (first len(excerpt) chars). Report.

